{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t法國總理勒科爾尼說，已要求地方各省政府，根據情況設立宵禁，從而保護商鋪免受破壞分子搶掠。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n勒科爾尼表示，若有必要，可宣布國家進入緊急狀態。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n根據早前宣布，在當地星期一中午12時至晚上8時，法國第二大城市馬賽禁止一切公共集會或示威活動。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：羅宇光\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T12:59:05.397684+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:33:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T13:58:04.266144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T12:57:35.569044+00:00","content_hash":"2c89327f27780321e5284e4790b4b57bf9f2a3d44722802a6d4af2a53f7efd5b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}